---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import localMugPicture from "../assets/lucien-immink.jpg";
---

<div>
  <Picture
    src={localMugPicture}
    widths={[90, 40, 267, localMugPicture.width]}
    sizes={`(max-width: 360px) 90px, (max-width: 720px) 40px, (max-width: 1600px) 267px, ${localMugPicture.width}px`}
    formats={["avif", "webp"]}
    alt="Lucien Immink"
    decoding="async"
    loading="eager"
  />
  <h1>Bio</h1>
  <p>Lucien Immink, also known as <span class="mono" title="Lucien Immink">&lt;li&gt;</span></p>
  <p>
    Is a former software engineer who, at some point, saw the light and embraced Clippy as his digital overlord.
  </p>
  <p>
    As a Principal Consultant, <span class="mono" title="Lucien Immink">&lt;li&gt;</span> helps organisations turn complex digital challenges into clear decisions, realistic strategies, and solutions that deliver tangible value. Operating at the intersection of business, technology, and execution, he helps organisations translate digital ambitions into measurable outcomes.
  </p>
  <p>
    His areas of expertise include digital strategy, software quality, delivery excellence, accessibility, and modern product development. He does not see AI as an end in itself or as the buzzword of the month, but as a practical tool for gaining insights faster, making better decisions, and creating meaningful value for organisations and their customers. Clippy would accept nothing less.
  </p>
  <p>
    <span class="mono" title="Lucien Immink">&lt;li&gt;</span> has been a Google Developer Expert in Web Technologies since 2022 and is known for his pragmatic approach, analytical mindset, and healthy dislike of solutions that are more complicated than the problems they are trying to solve.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="/talk-list/">🏠 talk-list</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/talk-list/sessions/">📃 sessions</a>
    </li>
    <li><a href="//www.teamrockstars.nl">🏢 The place I work for</a></li>
    <li>
      <a href="//www.jsmusicdb.com">🎼 My spare-time music streamer</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="//www.github.com/lucienimmink"
        >🧑‍💻 Source-code for all my projects</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .mono {
    font-family: monospace;
  }
  div {
    position: sticky;
    top: 10px;
  }
  img {
    border-radius: 50%;
    max-width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1/1;
    height: auto;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-inline-start: 10px;
    a {
      color: var(--link-color);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem 0.25rem 0;
      display: inline-block;
      &:hover {
        color: var(--link-hover);
      }
      &:active,
      &:focus {
        color: var(--link-active);
      }
      &:visited {
        color: var(--link-visited);
      }
    }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 800px) {
    img {
      max-width: 30%;
      float: right;
      margin-block-start: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>
